#: stepford_trophy/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "TROPHY"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If it isn't my little snack."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well hello there."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ugh. You. Why did you come back?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ah, it's the human."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/6
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Is there something I can win?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/14
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Please tell me there's something I can win."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm here looking for Davi - have you seen him?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh. Not seen. Heard."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Shelley and I were in the middle of a set and we heard some rustling in the closet over there."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I was... kinda scared?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But Shelley stepped in and said some loud stuff which got me back on track!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Anyway, hadn't had time to check it out. Hadn't... thought of it really."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Scary things are hard to think about."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks for the help!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "'K I'm in the middle of scheduling a waxing appointment. See you later."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_inanimals/0/c-0/58/c-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And in my dreams..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/39
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'm on the case!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/50
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Blaugh!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talk, Stepford! Counterfeit objects. Go!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heard anything about 'counterfeit objects,' here in the house?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Wh... at..?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on! We know you know about these rumors!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You...?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Did you say 'counterfeit' objects? Is that what you said?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Counterfeit objects. That is correct."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't play dumb with us!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "OHHhh. Ok, 'counterfeit.'"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Because for a second I thought you said 'bounterfit' and I was like 'nope, definitely not.'"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That would make literally no sense!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Any day now."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell us the truth!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well... You see..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/g-0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A single drop of sweat slides down his temple."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/c-1/15/g-0/8/g-0/24/g-0/30
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "He's starting to sweat! It was him that started the rumor!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "No! I'm only sweating because I just came from thinking about a workout!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Go ahead. You can tell us. You started that rumor, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We know you didn't start that rumor, but we need to know who did!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I didn't, I tell you! It wasn't me!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then by god, tell me who did! Innocents could be in danger!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I don't think that's actually true."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sorry. I just got carried away.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shh! He doesn't know that!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's fine. Happens to me all the time."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well, now I do..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh, drat!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Now, Stepford, if you DIDN'T start the rumor, who DID?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I heard it from the Scandalabra!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/19
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "He told me that all the supposedly fine silverware in the house is actually fake!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/27
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Oh did he?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/35
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, we'll just have to have a little chat with old master Scandalabra, now won't we?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-2/15/c-0/15/g-0/43/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you Stepford. That will be all."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ok! Fine!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I was embarrassed to tell you because I know I shouldn't have been spreading rumors, but here it is."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordQuestion/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Last week the Scandalabra told me that all the supposedly genuine silverware in the house is actually fake!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "It's high time we got to the bottom of this!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's bring in the Scandalabra!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drag in the suspect!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about a chat with the Rumor-Monger-In-Chief?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Well, maybe not that violently. But sure."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "I'll meet you at Location One."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/g-0/8/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-5/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you there."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Which is?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/CaseoftheCounterfeit2/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Maggie"
msgid "Otherwise known as the Dining Room Table."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You see before you a glistening, oiled, male form: perfect in its chiseled majesty."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His gold (or is that bronze?) skin is perfectly smooth, his features flawless, and his face... stunning."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/25
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh! Hello there. Don't mind me, I'm just catching a bit of air."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Drool. Hi."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't mind me. I'm just... watching."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey there!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you use as a conditioner?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ah. Yes. I am rather worth taking a look at, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Howdy!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Just plain old metal polish, actually. It kind of does that naturally..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My god."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... Mine too..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I know. It's ridiculous."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh! Nice! It looks lovely."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'm Stepford! Trophy of trophies, at your service."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I've just been standing here all covered with oil, waiting for a good sunbeam to come along."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you a trophy of, exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/20/s/5
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "! Nice to meet you."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/21/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I'm still drooling."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh, this and that! Depends on the day."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "For example, yesterday I was trophy for the \"First Out of the Cabinet\" Cup."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But I've also been given to the winner of the Cereal Bowl."
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/12
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid "? That's a winner's name if ever I've heard one."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually I'm a bit of a loser."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Most definitely."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's alright. We can't all win first every time."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I think they make participation trophies..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Though I wouldn't know anything about them, personally."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-5/20/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Nice to meet another champion!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's... not unusual."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Take your time."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "So what brings you around these parts?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thought I might exercise a little."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just checking in on things."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping to meet a handsome, oiled-up hunk, actually."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ah yes! The old 'exercise.' Quite good for the... um... ligatures."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you mean ligaments?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's your favorite exercise?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Of course! Yes. Those."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well, would you look at the time!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well, everything's going along well here! First place, and all that."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-9/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And are you satisfied with what you've found?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh yes."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hoping to find... more."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'm glad. Despite being a natural, I work hard to keep all this up."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-1/c-9/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well, that might happen later down the line."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "As it so happens, I have a self-tanning appointment coming up."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Can't be late!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But I'm so glad we met! Come and see me again soon, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/24/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And be sure to bring that fantastic red shirt..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/25/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'd love to... uh... ask your opinion on something."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/29/s/0 stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/49/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/19/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-1/15/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/11/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/35/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-2/24/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-5/24/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/stepford_trivia_friends/0/goodtogo/17/s/0 stepford_trophy/Skipped_Athletics/0/c-0/15/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/Skipped_Athletics/0/c-2/15/1/s/0 stepford_trophy/stepford_athleticsTraining/0/45/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, I need to ask you about a case with Maggie!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-2/c-11/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/c-20/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-8/26/c-0/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/19/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-1/15/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/11/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/35/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-2/24/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-5/24/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_trivia_friends/0/goodtogo/c-8/7 stepford_trophy/Skipped_Athletics/0/c-0/15/c-1/13 stepford_trophy/Skipped_Athletics/0/c-2/15/c-1/13 stepford_trophy/stepford_athleticsTraining/0/45/c-3/15/c-1/13 stepford_trophy/stepford_event_not_ready/0/c-4/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrophyPrep_1/0/c-0/66/c-0/15/c-0/30/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/StepfordTrophyHello/0/g-0/c-5/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_love_return/0/c-3/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_friend_return/0/c-2/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_hate_return/0/c-1/7 stepford_trophy/stepford_realize_return/0/c-2/10
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Mmmm..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_first_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Gotta tan!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You find Stepford polishing his well-muscled arm vigorously. He appears to be muttering to himself."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Stepford, what's up?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you got it..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What were you just saying to yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh, hey"
msgstr ""

#. Morceau de phrase coupé par une variable (nom du joueur, nombre...).
#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/c-0/12
msgctxt "Narration / joueur"
msgid ". Sorry, I'm just trying to get this spot out."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Did I? Seems like it's still there. Shows right through the self-tanner!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "What? You heard that... Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Just trying to get this blasted spot off."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Not sure if you've noticed but I've gotten a bit... um... Bronze, lately."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I had noticed that, actually."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looking gold as ever to me!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Is it so obvious? Oh lord. You must think I'm hideous!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's sweet of you to say, but I know you can see right through me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "...I don't know what I'm going to do about it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why's it happening, do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe it's natural."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't care what color you are. You're gorgeous no matter what."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I have an idea, but I can't be certain."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "You're right, you know."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's nice to hear but... I don't FEEL gorgeous."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "As a matter of fact, I feel sort of crummy."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's like this..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I got the way I am, all gold and beautiful and all, because in my youth I was extremely competitive."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I entered and won every contest I could find. I was a complete natural!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I never really needed to try."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I just showed up and showed off and showed everyone what first place looked like!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I lived for the competition: the cheering, the adoring fans, the tough opponents."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It was the life for me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what's the problem?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But it didn't last..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Trophies change over time."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Bingo."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If we stop competing, we turn into showpieces."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Our gold starts turning to silver, then to bronze..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's not that we stop getting given out, but our inner essence changes."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So that's what's happening to you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's only natural."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It is."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Yes. In a way, that's true."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Eventually, we come to a turning point."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's either get back in the fight, and risk the arena once more..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Or retire, and spend our time polishing up, clearing away the patina..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And covering up what can't be cleared away."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think that's just called aging."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like you need to get back out there."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Maybe you're right. But... There could be one last taste of glory..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/c-12/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh, I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "You make it sound so simple."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-4/c-13/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But I'm afraid it's not! There's all sorts of things that can happen..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "In any case... Now that we're getting to know one another, I have to tell you something."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I started doing all this tanning because... Well... I'm actually all pewter underneath."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Pewter!! Like, what place even is that? 12th?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Idk."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pewter is a tin-based alloy."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/c-14/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Exactly!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-5/c-15/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's so unsexy I can't even deal with it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'm afraid the time of decision is upon me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What will you do?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get in the ring, Stepford!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Retirement could be full of new joys..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Honestly, I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "What do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Retire - you've done enough!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Work hard and get back into competition form."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I seriously don't know nor care."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I have! As long as I never have to look in the mirror again..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ulp... maybe you're right..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-16/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ugh! You suck!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-17/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "You think I should?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-17/18 stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-18/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Maybe you're right..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-6/c-18/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Should I put my competition days behind me?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Thanks for talking to me. I think I'd better think about this for a bit."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's not an easy decision."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If I compete again, I could get hurt, or even... <i>gulp</i> lose!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And I don't think I could bear that!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/40
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Come see me again some time soon, ok?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_second_encounter/0/g-7/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you around..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stepford is pacing when you find him, giving himself what seems to be a pep talk."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/14
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Come on, Stepford, just go sign up for it!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/22
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "What's the worst that could happen?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/30
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "A lot! That's what could happen!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/38
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I better avoid it altogether."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/46
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But... But what if I won? What if?!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/54
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It would be everything I've ever dreamed of! Oh, I don't know!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi there! Seems like you're in a bit of a pickle."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let me guess... Thinking about competing again?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Is it that obvious?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean you were literally just talking to yourself about it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's alright! What are you trying to decide on?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Was I? Oops."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Guess I just feel like I do my best thinking out loud."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "A little contest..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Remember how I told you there came a decision point in every trophy's life?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I think mine has come. But I don't know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe I can help."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sucks."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Really? You'd help me? That's so nice of you."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/18
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And here I thought everybody hated me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I'll help. Give me a little context?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hang on a second. Everybody hates you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's because of the way I look."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-4/29/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Not sure if you noticed, but I'm sort of... well..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Yeah... it does."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Everybody here hates me because of the way I look."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I just look..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gorgeous?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Staggeringly attractive?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Amazingly appetizing?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stupid?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Took the word right out of my mouth."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I have been known to make others stagger!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'm yummy! That's not my fault!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-2/c-9/18
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I look beautiful dammit. Your negging's not gonna work on me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Because I just happen to look like this, the others tend to get the wrong idea about me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If I don't say very much or look them in the eye all the time, they think I'm arrogant, or rude, or stuck up."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "The truth is I'm just shy."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm pretty shy, too."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Really? I never would have guessed. You seem so confident."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, you're kinda catching me in the midst of a dramatic life change."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You never know how someone is feeling just by looking at them."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's inspiring."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about it. Anyhow, back to the point! What's this dilemma you're having?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you <i>know</i> everyone hates you, or are you just making that assumption?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I guess I don't know for sure."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There you go. Don't shoot yourself down."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Huh... Ok."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And besides, if you go around thinking everyone hates you, you probably aren't going to make too many friends."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's a good point. Well, you don't seem to hate me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Who knows? Maybe this could be the beginning of a friendship."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like to think so."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Or even something more..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa there! Easy with the 'F' word!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/13/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Tantalize me more, Daddy..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/14/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Tantalize me more, Mommy..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Tantalize me more, babe..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_third_encounter/0/g-3/c-10/15/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh fuck, sorry. Didn't want to come on too strong."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Alright, so here's what's going on."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "For years now, the house has hosted an annual Trivia-Letics competition."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It includes a combination of difficult physical challenges!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And trivia challenges about objects found in houses!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/32
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's always a fierce competition, and everyone comes out to watch."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/40
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "The crowds, the cheering! It's my favorite thing..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds great!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It is!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Every year, I am presented to the winner as a trophy."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It's truly an honor! I spend days preparing."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "After all, I absolutely must have the chiseled physique that aches to be handled..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "The dazzling golden tan that captivates the eye, and the sly, mischievous smile that just..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...melts my clothes off?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we get the point."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Naughty! But also let's see if it works later."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Sorry! It's just part of the job."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Anyway, I always get brought up on stage making my big victorious pose..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And I listen to the cheering fans and..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It takes you back to when you used to compete?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You wish they were cheering for you, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/16/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "As if it were yesterday. And... Well..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/16/c-4/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Those cheers? I wish they were for me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-1/16/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I do. I have to confess, I really do."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But they're never cheering for me."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And they never will, unless you get out there and compete."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They could be..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Exactly! But what if I lose? I don't know if I could bear it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "It would be so embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'd have to admit in front of everyone that I spent all my time training to win..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/31
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "...and no time preparing to be a great trophy."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/39
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "My physique would be a mere 'tantalizing.'"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/47
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "My tan? A dull silver, at best."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/55
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And my smile would be an ordinary, run of the mill 'irresistible.'"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/66/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's nothing 'ordinary' about your smile, whatsoever."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/66/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're trying to decide whether the risk is worth it?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/66/c-0/13
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Maybe that's because you're giving me something extraordinary to smile about."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-6/66/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I know! I know... but they could also be booing me!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you stay worried about losing, you'll never win."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Forget about that! You're a trophy!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "You're right! I should focus on my potential!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "But there's my potential to win, and my potential to be given to the winner..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "That's where I'm stuck."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Hmm. So I'm going to the winner anyway?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I guess that's encouraging."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And so, you see, my time of decision has drawn nigh!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Dare I try my hand at being a trophy winner? Or remain a winning trophy?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "There can be no middle ground."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Should I spend the remaining time before the Trivia-letics competition preparing myself to be the best trophy out there?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Or should I sign up to compete, and spend my time training?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you should sign up for the competition!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you should work on that tan!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you and me should go find somewhere private to... hang out."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-8/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "By gosh I'm gonna do it! That was the push I needed!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-8/18
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'll go right now! Wish me luck!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-8/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, I also need to ask you about a case with Maggie!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-8/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Luck!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I knew it needed some attention!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If you'll excuse me, I need to oil some... um... 'currently concealed' places."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have I mentioned that I'm very helpful? I <i>love</i> to help."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll give you your privacy!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could, for example, be easily convinced to help you apply tanning lotion."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. I can just pretend to be the sun and... watch."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/13/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I guess I could let you help..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/13/b/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You spread the tanning lotion onto each hand and rub your palms together vigorously. You set to work, massaging the lotion into Stepford's bronzed skin."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/13/b/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can feel him relaxing into your touch; he groans quietly."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/13/b/25
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Mmmmmm that feels amazing. You've got such a gentle touch."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/13/b/36
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Come back in a little while and maybe we can try something else?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-0/16/b/1 stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/16/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Haha! You're so cute. Come on back in a bit, and we'll see what other prep needs to be done!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/13/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I guess I could let you keep an eye out... Enjoy the show."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/13/b/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stepford reveals his glistening body bit by bit. It is everything you could want it to be."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/13/b/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try (however unsuccessfully) to prevent yourself from drooling."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/13/b/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Stepford throws you a wink and a smirk. He knows what he's got."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/13/b/36
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Come on back later if you want to try something else..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-0/15/c-1/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you around... Stepford..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "See you again soon!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-9/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/7/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I don't see anybody around. How about we 'hang out' right here?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/7/b/9
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'd be happy to strip down and show you a few poses..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/7/b/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He does, but you will have to use your imagination on that one."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/7/b/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The time you spend together is marvelous, and teaches you previously unimaginable things about the various nooks and crannies of your trophies."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/7/b/36
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "But all good things must come to an end, so you take your leave."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/8/b/1
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Maybe another time?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordDilemma/0/g-4/c-10/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be going, then..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Great to see you again! I'm signed up for the competition."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "The other competitors are really good."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/16
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Like, really good."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who are they?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't sweat it!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "My old rivals from charm school!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oscar, he always watches classic movies to get pumped up."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "There's Graham - the king of workout playlists."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And Emma is even here!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And Paul Itzer?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tough competition..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh, he and Noble aren't into competition too much. They've always been a little uptight."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I guess I'm ready to start, though."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... um... Actually, I was thinking you should stick to being a trophy and not compete?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's awesome! Alright. Let's get started!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "...I guess I can go cross my name off."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Come back soon if you want to help me work on my tan!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-2/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See ya!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Started with...?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Training!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh! Yes! Training! I'll start by... um... doing heel lifts."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Heel lifts?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Yes! And then... uh... I'll do some... eyelash touches?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/18/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've never trained before in your life, have you?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/18/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "If I say 'no,' can we still be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/18/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sigh.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Ok, so I've never trained! But I'm already very disciplined."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I just need a game plan."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Given the competition consists of two categories, why not train for each separately?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know what? I think it would be best if you trained on your own."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Great idea!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "So, the categories would be 'Trivia About Other Household Occupants' and 'Athletics.'"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Which should we start with?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's get you nice and sweaty."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How about we work on the knowledge part?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On second thought, I think I'll just catch you at the competition."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I love it."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Sounds like a great idea."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I have a list of objects who might appear in the competition as questions..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "The big ones that I was told to concentrate on are dryers..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "...triangles..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/39
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "...and existential dread."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's see here..."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh. Um... Ok. I'll see you there!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-4/31/c-2/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/StepfordTrainingMontage_1/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Oh. Um... Ok. I'll see you at the competition!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/12
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I'm so ready. Go for it!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok! What can you tell me about dryers?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Absolutely nothing!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll want to brush up on that, then. What about triangles?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Nothing whatsoever!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes. Off to a bad start. How about Existential Dread?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Never even heard of him!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you know... anything, about... any thing in the house?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm starting to have doubts about your follow-through."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "I know Shelley. She has great muscles. We work out together."
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Other than that though...?"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "Like I said, I'm super shy!"
msgstr ""

#: stepford_trophy/stepford_triviaTraining/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Stepford"
msgid "And until very recently, I was convinced that everyone hated me!"
msgstr ""

